# roundsect.part -- A bar whose flat sides run into rounds, for sections
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A bar 30 by 10 across and 20 long along y, its corners round by 4.6:
# its two short sides are flat for .8 mm only, between the rounds.  A
# section across it shows each flat side as one line, upright, at x 0
# and at x 30, however the rounds are thinned to the chord.
profile p along y 0 0 4.6 30 0 4.6 30 10 4.6 0 10 4.6
extrude bar from 0 to 20 p
